        <item>
            <title>1.14.0</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 12 Jun 2026 15:10:06 +0000</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/stefanlange/ccInfo</link>
            <sparkle:version>1.14.0</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.14.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Add support for the new Fable model, with its own badge, 1M context window, and cost estimates; the bundled pricing data also covers Opus 4.7 and 4.8</li>
<li>Estimate costs more accurately for long sessions by using each model&#39;s real long-context pricing instead of one fixed surcharge above 200k tokens</li>
<li>Fix the usage chart&#39;s current-value glow getting clipped at the left and right edges</li>
</ul>

]]></description>
